    m_Localized: Scrapyard Loop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168213
    m_Localized: Frostbite Pass
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168214
    m_Localized: Neon Mile
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168215
    m_Localized: Canyon Run
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168216
    m_Localized: Smelter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168217
    m_Localized: Glacier Ring
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168218
    m_Localized: Downtown Carnage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168219
    m_Localized: The Crucible
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168220
    m_Localized: A wide, flowing loop through the dunes with one tight hairpin. Learn your car here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168221
    m_Localized: Four hard corners round the junkyard and a chicane between stacks of rusting containers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168222
    m_Localized: The longest straight in the land, then S-bends over an icy mountain pass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168223
    m_Localized: Right-angle turns between city blocks, then a flat-out run down the neon-lit back straight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168224
    m_Localized: A long, twisting road through the red canyons, with a narrow gorge where passing is a gamble.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168225
    m_Localized: 'Tight and technical: corner after corner between the furnaces. Brake early, shoot often.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168226
    m_Localized: Fast sweeping curves on a wide road of packed snow. Keep your foot down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168227
    m_Localized: A brutal city circuit with a double hairpin that turns the field into a demolition derby.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168228
    m_Localized: 'The Warden''s arena: a short, wide loop ringed by fire pits. Only one driver leaves as champion.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168229
    m_Localized: "Split screen  \xB7  {0}  \xB7  {1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168230
    m_Localized: "Online race  \xB7  {0}  \xB7  {1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974168231
    m_Localized: 1 lap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266059591680
    m_Localized: Pit Crew
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117632
    m_Localized: Repairs cost nothing between races
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117633
    m_Localized: $5,000 Cash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117634
    m_Localized: Five thousand dollars into your career's wallet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117635
    m_Localized: Kept in your career
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117636
    m_Localized: Jackal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117637
    m_Localized: Mauler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117638
    m_Localized: Banshee
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117639
    m_Localized: Spectre
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117640
    m_Localized: Goliath
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117641
    m_Localized: Apocalypse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117642
    m_Localized: 'A dune buggy: a roll cage, an engine and nothing to hide behind. First off the line, first to fall apart.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117643
    m_Localized: An armoured security van with a battering ram. Slow, but everything bounces off it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117644
    m_Localized: A supercharged muscle car that screams down the straights and sulks in the corners.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117645
    m_Localized: A matte stealth hypercar. By the time you hear it, it has passed you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117646
    m_Localized: A war rig with a plough, twin guns and armour plate. It does not overtake; it goes through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117647
    m_Localized: A jet-assisted interceptor built from the Warden's own blueprints. The last car you will ever need.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117648
    m_Localized: Refinery Row
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117649
    m_Localized: Avalanche Ridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117650
    m_Localized: Gridlock Boulevard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117651
    m_Localized: A flat-out sweep round the storage tanks, then a narrow box of corners through the pipe racks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117652
    m_Localized: Two hairpins up the mountain, a narrow ice shelf along the ridge and a long sweeping run back down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117653
    m_Localized: 'The longest circuit in the city: a flat-out boulevard, a tight chicane between the blocks and tyre walls at the stops.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117654
    m_Localized: A podium at {0} or a career in the {1} opens it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117655
    m_Localized: 'Armed cars, twelve deadly tracks and three leagues of twenty drivers: race, shoot and ram your way to the top, and spend the prize money on a better car.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117656
    m_Localized: BURNING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117657
    m_Localized: JAMMED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117658
    m_Localized: SLICKED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117659
    m_Localized: ON FIRE!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117660
    m_Localized: JAMMED!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117661
    m_Localized: OIL!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117662
    m_Localized: Special weapon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117663
    m_Localized: Machine Gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117664
    m_Localized: Minigun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117665
    m_Localized: Flamethrower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117666
    m_Localized: Plasma Cannon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117667
    m_Localized: 'The gun every car comes with: steady, accurate and good for a long way.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117668
    m_Localized: 'Six spinning barrels: a storm of lighter rounds that eats through a car and through the ammunition.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117669
    m_Localized: 'A jet of burning fuel: short reach, no aiming needed, and whatever it touches keeps burning.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117670
    m_Localized: Slow, heavy bolts of plasma that fly true and burst on whatever they hit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117671
    m_Localized: Oil Slick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117672
    m_Localized: EMP Blast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117673
    m_Localized: Mortar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117674
    m_Localized: 'A barrel of sump oil poured behind you: whoever drives through it loses the road for a moment.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117675
    m_Localized: 'An electric pulse that jams every car near you: no guns, no nitro and a coughing engine for a few seconds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117676
    m_Localized: A shell lobbed over the cars ahead that bursts where it lands. Best fired into a crowded corner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117677
    m_Localized: Roll Cage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117678
    m_Localized: Blast Shielding
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117679
    m_Localized: Radar Jammer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117680
    m_Localized: Field Welder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117681
    m_Localized: Extended Magazine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117682
    m_Localized: The gun hits half as hard again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117683
    m_Localized: 'A welded cage of steel tube: crashes into cars and barriers hurt far less.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117684
    m_Localized: 'Plate under the floor and round the tank: mines, rockets, shells and explosions hurt less.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117685
    m_Localized: 'A box of noise on the roof: homing rockets never lock on to you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117686
    m_Localized: 'A robot arm with a torch: the car mends itself slowly while nobody is hitting it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117687
    m_Localized: 'Bigger ammunition boxes: the gun carries half as many rounds again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117688
    m_Localized: Wasteland Circuit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117689
    m_Localized: Iron League
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117690
    m_Localized: 'The circuit for drivers who survived the wasteland: armoured cars, sharper rivals and The Iron Baron at the top.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117691
    m_Localized: Hellfire League
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117692
    m_Localized: 'The last ladder: the fastest cars ever built, the best drivers alive, and Nemesis waiting at the end.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117693
    m_Localized: The Iron Baron
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117694
    m_Localized: Rules the Iron League from a war rig plated with his rivals' doors. He has never lost a Showdown.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117695
    m_Localized: Nemesis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117696
    m_Localized: Nobody knows where Nemesis came from. Everybody knows where the rivals went.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117697
    m_Localized: Gearbox Gus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117698
    m_Localized: Strips his rivals' cars for parts after the race.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117699
    m_Localized: Patch Perkins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117700
    m_Localized: Half his car is duct tape. The other half is armour.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117701
    m_Localized: Rivet Rosa
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117702
    m_Localized: Builds her own cars and blows up everyone else's.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117703
    m_Localized: Big Earl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117704
    m_Localized: Weighs as much as his engine and drives like it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117705
    m_Localized: Kid Kerosene
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117706
    m_Localized: Too young to drive, old enough to set you on fire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117707
    m_Localized: Slick Vinnie
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117708
    m_Localized: Every corner he takes, he leaves a puddle of oil in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117709
    m_Localized: Tank Tatiana
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117710
    m_Localized: Learned to drive in an armoured column. It shows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117711
    m_Localized: Ricochet Ray
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117712
    m_Localized: Never aims. Hits anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117713
    m_Localized: The Mechanic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117714
    m_Localized: Fixes his car between corners. Fixes yours for good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117715
    m_Localized: Widowmaker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117716
    m_Localized: Her rivals' families send the flowers in advance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117717
    m_Localized: Dr. Detonator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117718
    m_Localized: A chemist with a mortar and a doctorate in blowing things up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117719
    m_Localized: Bloody Mary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117720
    m_Localized: Red car, red visor, red mist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117721
    m_Localized: Copperhead
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117722
    m_Localized: Strikes from the inside line without a sound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117723
    m_Localized: Grinder Gray
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117724
    m_Localized: Rides your door until the paint gives out, then the metal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117725
    m_Localized: Black Betty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117726
    m_Localized: Her engine is the last thing a rival hears.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117727
    m_Localized: Duke Dynamo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117728
    m_Localized: Charged his first EMP off a power line. Still tingles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117729
    m_Localized: Steel Sven
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117730
    m_Localized: Built like his roll cage, and just as hard to bend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117731
    m_Localized: Fury Fontaine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117732
    m_Localized: Champion of three wastelands and a sore loser in all of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117733
    m_Localized: Count Carnage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117734
    m_Localized: The Baron's right hand, and sure he is next in line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117735
    m_Localized: Ash Ashford
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117736
    m_Localized: Survived the Iron League. Barely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117737
    m_Localized: Cinder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117738
    m_Localized: Nobody remembers her real name. Nobody asks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117739
    m_Localized: Hot Rod Harry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117740
    m_Localized: Three hundred races, three hundred wrecks, one smile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117741
    m_Localized: Lady Lava
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117742
    m_Localized: 'Drives like molten rock: slow to start, impossible to stop.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117743
    m_Localized: Jet Jansen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117744
    m_Localized: Strapped a jet engine to a hearse. Won with it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117745
    m_Localized: Pyro Pete
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117746
    m_Localized: Thinks a flamethrower is a steering aid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117747
    m_Localized: Hellcat Hana
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117748
    m_Localized: Smaller than her car and meaner than her guns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117749
    m_Localized: The Surgeon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117750
    m_Localized: Takes your car apart one precise shot at a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117751
    m_Localized: Brimstone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117752
    m_Localized: Leaves scorch marks on the grid before the lights go out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117753
    m_Localized: Mother Mayhem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117754
    m_Localized: Raised half the drivers on this ladder. Wrecked the other half.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117755
    m_Localized: Zero
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117756
    m_Localized: No name, no face, no mercy, no brakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117757
    m_Localized: Inferno Ivy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117758
    m_Localized: Burns everything she passes, her bridges included.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117759
    m_Localized: Major Mortar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117760
    m_Localized: Shells the corners ahead as if the war never ended.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117761
    m_Localized: Static Sasha
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117762
    m_Localized: Her EMP has stopped more cars than her guns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117763
    m_Localized: Wraith
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117764
    m_Localized: Appears in your mirror, then in your wreckage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117765
    m_Localized: Doomsday Dan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117766
    m_Localized: Has been predicting your end since the first lap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117767
    m_Localized: Valkyrie
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117768
    m_Localized: Chooses who leaves the race. Never herself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117769
    m_Localized: Overkill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117770
    m_Localized: Every weapon he owns, all at once, all the time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117771
    m_Localized: The Butcher's Daughter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117772
    m_Localized: Carries on the family trade with better tools.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117773
    m_Localized: Nitro System
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117774
    m_Localized: 'Bigger injectors: every nitro charge burns longer and pushes harder.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117775
    m_Localized: Gun Mount
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117776
    m_Localized: 'A heavier mount and faster feed: the gun fires faster, hits harder and carries more rounds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117777
    m_Localized: It is on the bonnet already
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117778
    m_Localized: It is fitted already
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167266114117779
    m_Localized: Workshop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
